w-green status cells and a 12-month work calendar). Do not redesign, simplify, recolor, or rebrand the box. SET & PROPS: Head of puskesmas office in the early morning: a desk with a laptop and a plain document folder, a window behind showing a puskesmas courtyard where staff in uniforms stand in a line as blurred shapes, soft morning sunlight, no readable signs. TIMELINE — 10 seconds: 0–2s Hook · medium shot through the window: staff lining up as blurred shapes; cut to him straightening his shirt and looking to the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Saya kapus paling muda di sini." Delivery (EN): honest, slightly nervous 2–4s Problem · medium shot, he glances back at the window. VO (ID, verbatim): "Tim saya lebih senior semua." Delivery (EN): honest 4–6s Problem · medium close-up, hands resting on the desk. VO (ID, verbatim): "Mereka tanya arah kerja tahun depan." Delivery (EN): concerned 6–8s Problem · medium shot, he opens an almost empty folder. VO (ID, verbatim): "Saya tidak mau terlihat bingung." Delivery (EN): quiet, firm 8–10s Beat · medium shot, he takes a breath and sits down. VO: none. AUDIO: Morning ambience, distant voices of staff gathering, birds. Only the talent speaks. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: follow the camera style above consistently; stable and restrained, no whip pans, no drone, no 360 orbit. Keep product readable whenever it is on screen. Performance: natural facial expression, believable professional UGC, natural eye contact, restrained gestures, no exaggerated acting. Lips clearly synced to each word. Hands: simple, natural, relaxed movements. CLEAN OUTPUT: No subtitles, captions, generated text overlays, watermark, poster layout, storyboard panels, or added graphics. Do not invent product details, claims, prices, ratings, testimonials, certifications, or guarantees. Keep exact talent face, the WARDROBE above, product shape, colors, packaging, box title, emblem, document folders, laptop screen content, and visual details consistent with the DNA references.